## trixie-backports, enabled ONLY inside the reproducibility compare container
## (copied by ci/reproducible-install-deps) to pull diffoscope >= 302 -- the
## streaming fix that avoids OOM on a large differing image member; trixie ships
## 297. This is NOT one of the image build's apt sources (build_sources/), which
## is why it lives under ci/ and is copied in, not selected by the build.
##
## Deliberately LIVE (deb.debian.org, not a snapshot pin): diffoscope is the
## comparison TOOL, not part of the reproducible artifact, so the latest backports
## build is fine and pinning it would be needless complexity. The frozen
## build_sources/ files cannot be reused here anyway -- they point at the approx
## proxy (127.0.0.1:9977), which the compare container has no access to.
Types: deb
URIs: http://deb.debian.org/debian
Suites: trixie-backports
Components: main
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/debian-archive-keyring.gpg
